Targets: wasm
Releases: 12.0-
Subject: Build the WebAssembly port files into the backend
Purpose: The build file of src/backend/port lists the object files; wasm_shm.o (patch 0200), wasm_sema.o (0240) and wasm_embed.o (0260) have to be in the list. It is a patch of its own because the lines around the list differ from one series to the next: one variant per series. 9.2 has other lines around the list than 9.1, so it has its own variant (the one for 9.0 and 9.1 is capped at 9.1.24). This variant is for 9.5, whose object list starts with atomics.o; the sibling for 9.2 to 9.4 is capped at 9.4.26. This variant is for 9.6, whose object list no longer has pg_latch.o (the latch code moved to storage/ipc); the sibling for 9.5 is capped at 9.5.25. This variant is for 10, whose backend/port/Makefile has other lines around the object list (the hunk keeps one line of context); the sibling for 9.6 is capped at 9.6.24. This variant is for 12, whose object list has no dynloader.o any more (the hunk keeps one line of context); the sibling for 10 and 11 is capped at 11.22.
Components: src/backend/port/Makefile
Checks: wasm/build.sh links postgres with no undefined symbols
Origin: own

diff --git a/src/backend/port/Makefile b/src/backend/port/Makefile
--- a/src/backend/port/Makefile
+++ b/src/backend/port/Makefile
@@ -23,3 +23,3 @@
 
-OBJS = atomics.o pg_sema.o pg_shmem.o $(TAS)
+OBJS = atomics.o pg_sema.o pg_shmem.o wasm_shm.o wasm_sema.o wasm_embed.o $(TAS)
 
